# Header bao mat cho trang tinh (Workers Static Assets doc file nay) - 2026-10-08, danh gia bao mat.
# API (/api/*) dat header rieng trong backend/src/lib/baoVe.ts.
# frame-ancestors 'self' (khong phai 'none'): App.tsx nhung CHINH app trong iframe de xem truoc giao dien Mobile.
# connect-src: docs.google.com (bang tinh cong khai, chuyen huong sang *.googleusercontent.com), drive/lh3 (doc tien tren
# anh chuyen khoan - lib/docTienAnh.ts). Them domain ngoai moi ma frontend goi fetch() -> them vao day.
# 'wasm-unsafe-eval' + blob: cho tesseract.js (OCR chay WebAssembly trong worker blob:).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://docs.google.com https://drive.google.com https://lh3.googleusercontent.com https://*.googleusercontent.com; frame-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://accounts.google.com; object-src 'none'; manifest-src 'self'
